Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_OwnerWaiting::
    .string "This is the SEASHORE HOUSE. Shade,\n"
    .string "cold drinks, and three who won't\l"
    .string "let a stranger past without a\l"
    .string "battle.\p"
    .string "Beat the three of them and the\n"
    .string "drinks are on the house.$"

Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_OwnerPrize::
    .string "All three! And one after another,\n"
    .string "in this heat.\p"
    .string "They've been beaten by the KANTO\n"
    .string "champion and they're delighted\l"
    .string "about it. Look at them.\p"
    .string "Here. You've earned the cold\n"
    .string "shelf.$"

Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_ReceivedSodaPop::
