Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_H1_0::
    .string "Three of us, one after another,\n"
    .string "and no resting in between.\p"
    .string "That's the house rule. I'm the\n"
    .string "first one.$"

Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_H1_1::
    .string "One down. Two to go, and they're\n"
    .string "both better than me.$"

Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_H1_2::
    .string "Keep going. The man behind the\n"
    .string "counter pays out at the end.$"

Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_H2_0::
    .string "You beat him, then. He is the warm\n"
    .string "water.\p"
    .string "I'm the cold.$"

Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_H2_1::
    .string "Cold didn't slow you down.$"

Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_H2_2::
    .string "One left. She hasn't lost in here\n"
    .string "since the house opened.$"

Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_H3_0::
    .string "Two in a row, no healing, and you\n"
    .string "still walked over to me.\p"
    .string "Let's see what's left of you.$"

Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_H3_1::
    .string "Everything, apparently.$"

Route109_SeashoreHouse_Text_H3_2::
    .string "Three in a row on a hot beach.\p"
    .string "Go and get your SODA POP. You've\n"
    .string "earned the whole crate.$"
